{
    "8": {
        "lines": [
            "　　This is Makai. A giant kingdom located in the world of neverending agony, hell.",
            "　　Here, monsters and humans are sent to overwork...",
            "    Until they can pay for their sins.",
            "　　It's creepy nature is satisfying for some, but agonizing for others.",
        ]
    },
    "12": {
        "lines": [
            "　　But anyways...",
            "　　After everything, Damelie and Kuri were interested in Miss Rudy.",
            "　　Interested enough to invite her to stay a little longer.",
        ]
    },
    "17": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kuri:$12345678> \"Hey Damelie...if we started the fake moon in another holiday..."
        ]
    },
    "20": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kuri:$12345678> \"Do you think We would've been able to get away with it?\""
        ]
    },
    "24": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Damelie:$12345678> \"Probably, Mistress.\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"I don't think holidays like easter have any powerful rulers.\""
        ]
    },
    "27": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kuri:$12345678> \"Easter! Yes! Chocolate rabbits...\""
        ]
    },
    "30": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"I'm so hungry for candy.\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"If only I could get easter chocolate on this table right now...\""
        ]
    },
    "33": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Damelie:$12345678> \"Such delight.\""
        ]
    },
    "36": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Damelie:$12345678> \"Just be sure to not eat too much chocolate.\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"Or your bust will end up just as big as Rudy's one.\""
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"With all that fat that she has there.\""
        ]
    },
    "40": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"Ahem Aheeem...",
            "<c$$12345678\"> I'm still in here can hear you two very well, you know?\""
    },
    "43": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kuri:$12345678> \"You looked too busy with your pumpkin milkshake.",
            "<c$$12345678\"> By the way, It is any good? I comissioned them.\""
        ]
    },
    "47": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678\"> \"It's ok.\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"Far better than I expected for a makai mock up.\"",
        ]
    },
    "51": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Damelie:$12345678> \"It isn't a mock up! Kuri asked all makai restaurants to make",
            "<c$$12345678\"> holiday food forever.\""
        ]
    },
    "54": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678\"> \"Is makai gastronomy THAT bad?",
            "<c$$12345678\"> I thought you guys liked eating weird crap.\""
        ]
    },
    "58": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Damelie:$12345678> \"Sometimes we like eating weird stuff too.\""
        ]
    },
    "63": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kuri:$12345678> \"Like human eyeballs with sugar...",
            "<c$$12345678\"> Absolute deliciosity! But we still want the new stuff.\""
            "<c$$12345678\"> Oh! I wonder how Valentine's day food may be like!\""
        ]
    },
    "66": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"It's probably just a bunch of chocolate and soda."",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"You might like that.\""
        ]
    },
    "69": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kuri:$12345678> \"Good! I'll comission that next time then!\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"All holiday food will be in makai!\""
        ]
    },
    "72": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"Good luck with that, girl.\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"I'm going back to halloween, see you two.\""
        ]
    },
    "75": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kuri:$12345678> \"Rudy, before you go...\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"Do you have any money to pay for this food?\""
        ]
    },
    "78": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Damelie:$12345678> \"What about making a rule that makes everything free for you?\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"You're Hell's ultimate overlord...and you don't have any money?\""
        ]
    },
    "81": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kuri:$12345678> \"Being Hell's ultimate overlord doesn't mean I'll have money!"
        ]
    },
    "83": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"Getting a job it's so boring when you have a perfect life...\""
        ]
    },
    "86": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kuri:$12345678> \"Actually! I'll make that a rule!",
        ]
    },
    "90": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kuri:$12345678> \"Now, all food in makai will be all free just for me and Damelie!\""
        ]
    },
    "93": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"Did you really just came with that idea just now?\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"Halloween's overlord first rule was to make everything free for her first day.\""
        ]
    },
    "96": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kuri:$12345678> \"Maybe thinking too much about holidays is making my mind all weird...\""
        ]
    },
    "99": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Rudy:$12345678> \"Yep, it is.\""
        ]
    },
    "101": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"Try to get a hobby, something like watching horror movies. I dunno.\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"I'm going now for real, see ya.\""
        ]
    },
    "104": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kuri:$12345678> \"Bring some fried candy and popcorn next time please.\""
        ]
    },
    "107": {
        "lines": [
            "　　Rudy headed back to halloween. Despite of that,",
            "　　she'll still keep an eye on Kuri to make sure she's not trying anything weird.",
        ]
    },
    "112": {
        "lines": [
            "　　Good ending No. 3!",
            "   \"The Underworld Overlord and her hunger.\""
        ]
    }
}